msgstr "A gbe akonti rẹ wá ibi lati {source}. Titi iwọ o fi pa rẹ nibẹ, awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn iwifunni le de olupin mejeeji, diẹ ninu akoonu rẹ tẹsiwaju lati sin lati olupin atijọ, ati awọn olutẹle le gba iṣẹju diẹ lati wa ọ nibi."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx:116
msgid "Your account will be permanently deleted on {purgeDate}. You've been signed out. To cancel, sign in again before then."
msgstr "A óò pa àkàǹtì rẹ rẹ́ pátápátá ní {purgeDate}. A ti mú ọ jáde. Láti fagilé, wọlé lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i kí ó tó di àkókò náà."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx:84
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "A óò ṣètò àkáǹtì rẹ láti pa rẹ́ a sì máa mú ọ jáde. O lè fagilé e nígbàkígbà kí ọjọ́ pípa rẹ́ tó dé nípa wíwọlé padà. Sì gba dátà rẹ sílẹ̀ kọ́kọ́ tí o bá fẹ́ pa ẹ̀dà kan mọ́."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/comment-composer.tsx:295
msgid "Your attachments will be lost."
msgstr "Àwọn fáìlì àsomọ́ rẹ yóò sọnù."

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:197
msgid "Your data"
msgstr "Data rẹ"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:131
msgid "Your data is downloading"
msgstr "Data rẹ n gba gbigba"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:179
msgid "Your private keys are included, encrypted with this passphrase. Store it safely. You'll need it to restore."
msgstr "Awọn bọtini aladani rẹ wa ninu, ti o wa ni koodu pẹlu gbolohun ọrọ igbaniwọle yii. Tọju rẹ ni ailewu. Iwọ yoo nilo rẹ lati mu pada."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/comment-composer.tsx:293
